{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":12,"ref":"1-samuel 31:12","book":"1-samuel","lang":"de","chapter":31,"translation":"Da machten sich auf alle wehrfähigen Männer und gingen die ganze Nacht und nahmen ⟨את⟩ den Leib Schauls und ⟨את⟩ die Leiber seiner Söhne von der Mauer von Bet-Schean, und sie kamen nach Jawescha und verbrannten ⟨את⟩ sie dort.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויקומו","gloss":"da machten sich auf"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"alle"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"Männer"},{"surface":"חיל","gloss":"wehrfähigen"},{"surface":"וילכו","gloss":"und gingen"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"die ganze"},{"surface":"הלילה","gloss":"Nacht"},{"surface":"ויקחו","gloss":"und nahmen"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"den Leib Schauls"},{"surface":"גוית","gloss":"den Leib"},{"surface":"שאול","gloss":"Schauls"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"und ⟨את⟩","marks":"die Leiber seiner Söhne"},{"surface":"גוית","gloss":"die Leiber"},{"surface":"בניו","gloss":"seiner Söhne"},{"surface":"מחומת","gloss":"von der Mauer von"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"Bet"},{"surface":"שן","gloss":"Schean"},{"surface":"ויבאו","gloss":"und sie kamen"},{"surface":"יבשה","gloss":"nach Jawescha"},{"surface":"וישרפו","gloss":"und verbrannten"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"sie"},{"surface":"שם","gloss":"dort"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T15:04:00.258361429Z","model":"glm-5.2"}